            "bestRating": "5",
            "worstRating": "1"
          },
          "reviewBody": "We hired Roam Morocco for a 4-day private circuit from Marrakech to Fes via the Merzouga Sahara. Our driver Rachid was magnificent—navigating the steep Tizi n'Tichka switchbacks with effortless precision in a pristine Prado 4x4. Highly recommended for couples wanting safety and complete peace of mind."
