            "@type": "Rating",
            "ratingValue": "5",
            "bestRating": "5",
            "worstRating": "1"
          },
          "reviewBody": "As a solo female traveler in Morocco, hiring Roam Morocco's private driver was the best decision I made. My chauffeur Karim met me inside Casablanca airport, escorted me to every riad door at night, and shielded me from touts. Respectful, professional, and immaculate service."
        },
        {
          "@type": "Review",
          "itemReviewed": {
            "@type": "Product",
            "name": "Morocco Private Driver & Chauffeur Service",
            "image": "https://roammorocco.tours/images/morocco_private_driver.webp"
