            "@type": "Rating",
            "ratingValue": "5",
            "bestRating": "5",
            "worstRating": "1"
          },
          "reviewBody": "The Mercedes V-Class VIP was spotless and spacious for our family of 5 with 7 large bags. Transparent all-inclusive pricing with zero surprises for fuel, parking, or tolls. Our driver stopped at authentic roadside cafés we would have never found on our own."
        },
        {
          "@type": "Review",
          "itemReviewed": {
            "@type": "Product",
