            "@type": "Rating",
            "ratingValue": "5",
            "bestRating": "5",
            "worstRating": "1"
          },
          "reviewBody": "Seamless VIP transfer from Casablanca CMN airport to Marrakech. Our flight was delayed by nearly 2 hours, but our driver was tracking our flight on radar and was waiting curbside with a personalized name board. Five-star executive execution."
        },
