          },
          "reviewBody": "We did the full 7-day Imperial Cities and Desert circuit. Our driver was like a trusted friend and guardian throughout Morocco. Clean, comfortable, air-conditioned Prado 4x4 and unbeatable Berber hospitality. Worth every euro."
