          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Why is hiring an officially licensed Transport Touristique vehicle critical over an unlicensed taxi?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Official tourist transport vehicles in Morocco operate under a strict Ministry of Tourism permit (Agr\u00e9ment de Transport Touristique), recognizable by green or blue commercial plates, comprehensive commercial passenger insurance (Assurance Transport), and an official mission manifest (Ordre de Mission). Royal Gendarmerie and S\u00fbret\u00e9 Nationale highway checkpoints strictly inspect these credentials on all routes. Unlicensed private cars or informal pirate taxis recruited off street corners lack commercial passenger liability insurance and face immediate vehicle impoundment at police checkpoints, stranding travelers on rural mountain roads. Roam Morocco operates 100% legally compliant, accredited vehicles."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
