          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Tipping is customary and greatly appreciated for good service. A standard gratuity is 100 to 150 MAD (\u20ac10 to \u20ac15) per day from a couple, or 200 to 300 MAD (\u20ac20 to \u20ac30) per day for a family or small group. Tips are customarily given directly to your chauffeur in cash on the final day of your journey."
